  "instructions": [
    "heat coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "add chicken to skillet and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, and cayenne pepper to skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add molasses to skillet and stir to combine.",
    "cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "stir in yogurt and cook for 1 minute.",
    "serving hot, garnish with chopped cilantro.",
    "transfer to dolsot stone bowl and serve immediately."
